     7	    """Everyone knows Fibonacci sequence, it was studied deeply by mathematicians in 
     8	    the last couple centuries. However, what people don't know is Tribonacci sequence.
     9	    Tribonacci sequence is defined by the recurrence:
    10	    tri(1) = 3
    11	    tri(n) = 1 + n / 2, if n is even.
    12	    tri(n) =  tri(n - 1) + tri(n - 2) + tri(n + 1), if n is odd.
    13	    For example:
    14	    tri(2) = 1 + (2 / 2) = 2
    15	    tri(4) = 3
    16	    tri(3) = tri(2) + tri(1) + tri(4)
    17	           = 2 + 3 + 3 = 8 
    18	    You are given a non-negative integer number n, you have to a return a list of the 
    19	    first n + 1 numbers of the Tribonacci sequence.
    20	    Examples:
    21	    tri(3) = [1, 3, 2, 8]
    22	    """
